  "setting": "空格高櫃林立的長廳",
  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "那麼大的櫃子，只留著一個小盒。她把果實數過，帶過空曠的玻璃屋，最後放到另一個人面前。等盒子空了，仍有一杯水、一張長凳，和回去的路。",
  "lead_en": "So many shelves, and one small box. She counts its fruit and carries it through an empty glasshouse. At last, she sets a fruit before someone else. When the box is empty, there is still water, a bench, and a way back.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "那麼大的櫃子，只留著一個小盒。她把果實數過，帶過空曠的玻璃屋，最後放到另一個人面前。等盒子空了，仍有一杯水、一張長凳，和回去的路。\n\n最後一顆果實不在盒裡。\n他仍然老去，她也需要休息。\n抽屜合上以後，\n保管者終於空著手。",
  "statement_en": "So many shelves, and one small box. She counts its fruit and carries it through an empty glasshouse. At last, she sets a fruit before someone else. When the box is empty, there is still water, a bench, and a way back.\n\nThe last apple is no longer in the box.\nHe still grows old. She, too, needs rest.\nWhen the drawer closes,\nthe keeper has empty hands.",
  "afterword": "最後一顆果實不在盒裡。\n他仍然老去，她也需要休息。\n抽屜合上以後，\n保管者終於空著手。",
  "afterword_en": "The last apple is no longer in the box.\nHe still grows old. She, too, needs rest.\nWhen the drawer closes,\nthe keeper has empty hands.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
